   104	      UNI-RTN.
   105            DISPLAY 'University Code: ' LINE 11 COLUMN 10.
   106		  ACCEPT UNC LINE 11 COLUMN 50.
   107		  EVALUATE UNC
   108		   WHEN 1
   109             MOVE 'UP' TO UNA
   110		   WHEN 2
   111             MOVE 'PUP' TO UNA
   112		   WHEN 3
   113             MOVE 'DLSU' TO UNA
   114		   WHEN 4
   115             MOVE 'ADMU' TO UNA
   116		   WHEN 5
   117             MOVE 'MAPUA' TO UNA
   118		   WHEN OTHER
